(7623901, 1234880, 135744, '<td valign="top">Where it the swan? Is it the black dot in the sky? Anyway fabulous atmospheric photo. Congrats!</td>', 'Where it the swan? Is it the black dot in the sky? Anyway fabulous atmospheric photo. Congrats!', '2019-04-08 05:16:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(7623911, 1234984, 96574, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Could only have been you. Funny I was only thinking about you just the other day, and whether you were still alive :-) and then when I saw this image I thought well there you go<br/> <br/>Now were  those stones already set up, or  did you do that? <br/> <br/>Congratulations. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hah, thanks.<br/> <br/>Im not sure who stacked these but this area has a lot of interesting things along the shoreline from concrete bunkers to brick wall remnants half buried in the sand.  It was a happy surprise to find these stacks put up the day I went to shoot the sunset.   Im sure theyre probably all but knocked down by now.</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Could only have been you. Funny I was only thinking about you just the other day, and whether you were still alive :-) and then when I saw this image I thought well there you go Now were  those stones already set up, or  did you do that?  Congratulations.   Hah, thanks. Im not sure who stacked these but this area has a lot of interesting things along the shoreline from concrete bunkers to brick wall remnants half buried in the sand.  It was a happy surprise to find these stacks put up the day I went to shoot the sunset.   Im sure theyre probably all but knocked down by now.', '2019-04-08 05:22:34.000000', NULL, 0),
