(7623948, 1235096, 181335, '<td valign="top">We were luck to discover this Lineated Barbet nesting holes just about 0.5 meter above eye level.So I decided to get alone my 600MM tele lens to shot in flying mode within the tight frame.Whether if I almost get the head cut off.As it''is a popular spot for most of the birder.I have taken over 30 hours to wait for the good lighting and moment.Appreciates all for the great comments.<br/></td>', 'We were luck to discover this Lineated Barbet nesting holes just about 0.5 meter above eye level.So I decided to get alone my 600MM tele lens to shot in flying mode within the tight frame.Whether if I almost get the head cut off.As it''is a popular spot for most of the birder.I have taken over 30 hours to wait for the good lighting and moment.Appreciates all for the great comments.', '2019-04-08 12:08:53.000000', NULL, 0),
